# locally-installed agent skills (fetched via `npx skills add`), vendored
# per-machine, not part of the project source
.agents/
skills-lock.json
# Contents rather than the directory itself: git never descends into an excluded directory, so
# `.claude/skills/` would make the negation below impossible.
.claude/skills/*
# Except the skills this project wrote about itself, which belong to the repo. Without this a
# project skill lives in one worktree and silently does not exist in the next.
!.claude/skills/pr-description/
